WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.467
Open Templates. Choose Project update to get started.

00:00:07.467 --> 00:00:14.933
Select a slide. Edit its title and content.

00:00:14.933 --> 00:00:22.400
Choose Present. Use the arrow keys to move through slides.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:29.867
Close the player. Create PowerPoint, then download your deck.
